  {
   "id": "clean-up-earth-367820@major-2026-10-03",
   "gameId": "clean-up-earth-367820",
   "displayName": "A Major New Update for Clean Up Earth",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-03T10:48:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "The major update introduces a new in-game shop, allowing you to spend the money earned while playing on outfits, accessories and disguises. It also brings new leaderboards, new music, new trophies, additional gameplay improvements...",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45436097/81775fdd2c3c8ea631be7db5fa61816ae853c177.jpg\"]...and pirates have appeared in parts of the world. They may not be much of a threat, but you’ll definitely enjoy sending them back to the sea.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45436097/0b13034b86c59cfb1ddbf2621607bb647962c8e5.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quiet Nights DLC — The Cleanup Continues at Night",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quiet Nights expands Clean Up Earth with three huge new areas to explore — desert, mountains and tropical islands — offering up to 9 additional hours of gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Each map brings new routes, new objectives, new obstacles and its own atmosphere. A brand-new gadget and new gameplay mechanics also change the way you explore and clean after dark.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "And something strange is happening at night… A mysterious dark force has appeared, blocking parts of the environment and forcing you to adapt before you can continue your cleanup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45436097/734e0feccc04e2c956d33d1f797acccb5550ccc6.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Customization DLC — Expand Your Style",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The new customization DLC adds exclusive outfits and accessories to the in-game shop, giving you even more ways to personalize your character.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Use the shop to browse the new cosmetic content and create a look that suits you before heading back into the cleanup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45436097/0346145d8b0c839979133caab50762b173ea4d92.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
